With a .booping marker above the cwd the run appends exactly one [scaffold] line, naming
the tree and the destination, to the attached vault's log.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  e2e_demo:
    tree:
      README.md: "hello world\n"
-- cmd --
booping scaffold core.e2e_demo.tree out
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
created dir out
--- /dev/null
+++ out/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+hello world
scaffolded 2 paths — 1 dirs created, 1 files created, 0 files overwritten
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [scaffold] core.e2e_demo.tree → out
